# W31g, c (k10): joins a in stag0201, goes on to stag0202 (matz00); sees one notice for a's three entries.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log c in stag0201
idle until frames>=300
explore matz00 yes until stage=stag0202,control fail epoch>=@500
log c in stag0202
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@900
log c sees the notice
idle until notices=0 fail frames>=1500
idle until frames>=2400 fail notices>=1
log c saw one notice only
